*** BEGIN PATCH SPEC ***
libffi 3.4.2 should be configured for x86_64 BlockOS using the BlockOS C
compiler and sysroot. Keep the x86_64 ABI backend enabled. Disable tests when
cross-building because they cannot execute on the build host.

Recommended configure inputs:
  --host=x86_64-blockos
  --build=$(./config.guess)
  --disable-docs
  --disable-multi-os-directory

The actual assembler/runtime ABI remains the BlockOS userspace ABI; do not
link libffi against a host libc.
*** END PATCH SPEC ***
